00:12:13.957 --> 00:12:15.497
She came to her condo.

00:12:15.530 --> 00:12:16.900
She pretended that she didn’t care.

00:12:18.270 --> 00:12:19.835
-But she came.
-I need to look around.

00:12:19.870 --> 00:12:24.798
I want to get to know this kid
because she is intriguing.

00:12:25.028 --> 00:12:26.011
[Here are the slippers.]

00:12:27.235 --> 00:12:30.746
This is P’Fon’s idea. It’s so Dokrak.

00:12:30.790 --> 00:12:32.601
She’s like a little princess.

00:12:33.090 --> 00:12:34.798
She needs someone
to help put her slippers on.

00:12:36.915 --> 00:12:37.699
Meow.

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:41.797
I miss Simba. I want to see him again.

00:12:41.948 --> 00:12:43.499
That’s Simba.

00:12:44.757 --> 00:12:47.300
-Look how much he loves me.
-He is so calm.

00:12:49.025 --> 00:12:50.102
[You can hold him.]

00:12:50.229 --> 00:12:51.802
[He won’t bite or scratch you.]

00:12:52.189 --> 00:12:53.598
[He’s nice, just like his owner.]

00:12:53.909 --> 00:12:55.002
[It’s okay.]

00:12:55.524 --> 00:12:58.002
[I’ve never held a cat before.
I don’t know how to do it.]

00:12:58.391 --> 00:12:59.422
Do you know how to do it?

00:12:59.444 --> 00:13:01.202
No, I really didn’t know how to do it.

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:02.903
[…you can just pat him.]

00:13:03.240 --> 00:13:06.240
That’s why we had to change the script.
Initially, she had to hold it.

00:13:06.266 --> 00:13:07.653
But when she tried to hold it,
he was hissing.

00:13:07.678 --> 00:13:10.007
He was going to bite me.
So we had to change the script.

00:13:10.840 --> 00:13:12.962
Simba barely walks around.

00:13:12.998 --> 00:13:14.401
He just sits around.

00:13:15.823 --> 00:13:17.604
He’s so cute.

00:13:17.742 --> 00:13:19.001
He looks like P’Fon.

00:13:19.034 --> 00:13:21.499
He was born to be a cat model.

00:13:22.115 --> 00:13:23.321
Do you hear it?

00:13:23.350 --> 00:13:26.299
No. Really? I never heard it.

00:13:26.440 --> 00:13:27.598
[He’s cute.]

00:13:31.214 --> 00:13:32.324
His fur is on my hair.

00:13:32.350 --> 00:13:34.500
-His fur is everywhere, on my face.
-It’s on my hair.

00:13:35.740 --> 00:13:37.810
[I never thought
I would be patting a cat.]

00:13:38.540 --> 00:13:40.789
-It’s on my hair.
-Simba’s fur?

00:13:40.819 --> 00:13:42.211
Yes. See? It’s on my hair.

00:13:42.232 --> 00:13:45.302
When someone held him up,
his fur was flying everywhere.

00:13:46.586 --> 00:13:48.294
[You are cuddling her.]

00:13:58.016 --> 00:13:59.920
You can tell that Key is very rich
by looking at her condo.

00:13:59.949 --> 00:14:00.899
Yes.

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:11.804
[You don’t seem to have a money problem.]

00:14:13.186 --> 00:14:15.000
[Why do you want to be my sugar baby?]

00:14:21.321 --> 00:14:23.103
[I don’t have any money problems.]

00:14:23.952 --> 00:14:25.602
[I just want to be your girl.]

00:14:27.056 --> 00:14:28.402
Can’t she be something else?

00:14:29.054 --> 00:14:31.325
How many times
has she been her girl in the story?

00:14:31.360 --> 00:14:32.804
[Stop being cryptic.]

00:14:34.592 --> 00:14:35.660
[What exactly do you want from me?]

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:36.404
I won’t tell you.

00:14:36.496 --> 00:14:38.007
She doesn’t tell me.

00:14:38.379 --> 00:14:39.992
Why can’t you figure it out yourself?

00:14:41.930 --> 00:14:42.804
There.

00:14:44.700 --> 00:14:46.798
[Everything is related to this tattoo.]

00:14:46.828 --> 00:14:48.602
Yes. Have you figured it out?

00:14:48.896 --> 00:14:49.534
No.

00:14:49.560 --> 00:14:50.454
[Who are you?]

00:14:50.484 --> 00:14:51.210
Right.

00:14:51.244 --> 00:14:52.900
I’m so upset.

00:14:55.597 --> 00:14:56.470
[Kiran Mahattanakit.]

00:14:56.494 --> 00:14:58.013
Look at how she’s pointing her toes.

00:14:58.030 --> 00:14:59.320
[Your last name is Mahattanakit…]

00:14:59.351 --> 00:15:00.720
Look at the way she leans her hip
against the table.

00:15:06.986 --> 00:15:08.400
[I want to be close]

00:15:09.311 --> 00:15:11.099
[to the person who saved my life.]

00:15:11.954 --> 00:15:13.400
Her story is slowly revealed.

00:15:17.761 --> 00:15:19.896
[The person who is my first love.]

00:15:21.597 --> 00:15:22.700
Are you talking about me?

00:15:25.247 --> 00:15:26.554
[Have we met before?]

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:28.297
She still asks that?

00:15:28.773 --> 00:15:30.502
Does she think the answer is no?

00:15:32.111 --> 00:15:33.087
[I won’t tell you]

00:15:33.118 --> 00:15:33.902
Right.

00:15:35.241 --> 00:15:37.004
[if we have met.]

00:15:37.174 --> 00:15:38.470
If she told me,
the story would come to an end.

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:40.697
Yes, there wouldn’t be a next episode.

00:15:40.970 --> 00:15:42.703
[You have to remember it yourself.]

00:15:44.700 --> 00:15:45.600
I have high expectations for this.

00:15:45.620 --> 00:15:46.903
This music score looks great.

00:15:50.148 --> 00:15:51.097
She’s confused.

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:54.299
-Do you remember her?
-Who is she?

00:15:55.188 --> 00:15:57.000
Again.

00:15:57.974 --> 00:15:59.297
I’m surprised.

00:16:00.454 --> 00:16:02.007
[But I can tell you this.]

00:16:03.035 --> 00:16:04.102
My head is getting bald.

00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:06.865
-Your hair is falling off?
-Yes.

00:16:09.311 --> 00:16:11.000
[You are my first love.]

00:16:12.680 --> 00:16:14.503
♪ I don’t… ♪ No song?

00:16:14.777 --> 00:16:17.413
Is she telling the truth?

00:16:17.440 --> 00:16:18.635
She’s just talking nonsense.

00:16:18.671 --> 00:16:19.982
Yes. Am I really her first love?

00:16:20.232 --> 00:16:21.700
A peck.

00:16:22.072 --> 00:16:23.062
Why are you smiling?

00:16:23.082 --> 00:16:26.004
I suddenly got a peck from a silly girl.

00:16:26.068 --> 00:16:26.517
I’m confused.

00:16:26.545 --> 00:16:28.300
Why did you grin?

00:16:28.328 --> 00:16:29.362
I was grinning.

00:16:30.976 --> 00:16:32.680
Now, you put on a straight face again.

00:16:32.705 --> 00:16:34.100
I keep a straight face.

00:16:36.844 --> 00:16:38.601
[…it doesn’t matter what I am to you.]

00:16:38.894 --> 00:16:40.997
I saw that you secretly smile.

00:16:41.120 --> 00:16:42.401
[I’ll accept it.]

00:16:42.712 --> 00:16:43.992
I’ll accept it all.

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:46.011
Key needs to be straightforward.
Stop being cryptic.

00:16:46.228 --> 00:16:47.602
My mom said that.

00:16:47.957 --> 00:16:49.097
Stop being cryptic.

00:16:49.681 --> 00:16:52.402
-Your mom said that?
-Yes. Key needs to be straightforward.

00:16:52.774 --> 00:16:53.699
Mommy?

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:02.967
-Don’t look at me like that.
-The end.

00:17:04.146 --> 00:17:07.496
It gives the background of each character.

00:17:08.100 --> 00:17:10.805
It makes the viewers curious
why Key got the tattoo.

00:17:11.274 --> 00:17:13.191
It also slightly reveals Key’s problem.

00:17:13.216 --> 00:17:14.802
That’s right.

00:17:15.013 --> 00:17:21.841
It shows the beginning of the relationship
between Chan, Key, and Jay.

00:17:21.869 --> 00:17:22.801
Okay.

00:17:22.925 --> 00:17:24.299
The three of them.

00:17:24.691 --> 00:17:27.983
It shows how they know each other.

00:17:28.148 --> 00:17:31.099
Don’t forget to check out Moonshadow.

00:17:31.207 --> 00:17:36.100
It airs every Wednesday
at 8.30 p.m. on GMM25.

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:42.377
Streaming is available every Wednesday
at 9.30 p.m. on oneD.

00:17:42.404 --> 00:17:44.245
That’s right. Don’t forget to stream it.

00:17:44.269 --> 00:17:46.274
You will see the uncut version.

00:17:46.294 --> 00:17:48.401
If you watch it on the streaming platform,

00:17:48.718 --> 00:17:52.632
you will see many scenes
that are edited out.

00:17:52.651 --> 00:17:56.241
This series has so many details.

00:17:56.262 --> 00:17:57.078
That’s right.

00:17:57.108 --> 00:18:00.697
-It’s better to watch the full version.
-That’s right.

00:18:01.071 --> 00:18:02.297
Please check it out.

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:08.525
